' 17-Jan-2022 set: Rename "Gain (IEEE)" to "Gain"
' 26-Jul-2021 set: Extract function to generate component string.
' 02-Jul-2021 set: Fix overwriting of farfield settings in multiple mode
' 16-Apr-2021 set: Added check for the validity of RCS results
' 24-Feb-2021 set: Allow general string values for script setting "GroupArrayType" - necessary for "Current plot settings" option for Array factor
' 06-Oct-2020 fsr: Allowed general string values for script setting "Linear" in PlotFFWithAllSettings - necessary for "dBm" option
' 11-Sep-2020 set: Fix tree path argument for GenerateFarfieldList in GenerateEnvelopePattern
' 26-Aug-2020 fsr: Added dBm option to CDF calculation; not using ScriptSetting directly to determine linear/dB anymore in CDF
' 17-Aug-2020 fsr: Fixed a problem with settings where (EndAngle - StartAngle) is not an even multiple of StepSize
' 18-Jun-2020 fsr: Further performance improvement for GenerateFarfieldList by using FarfieldCalculator object
' 06-Jun-2020 fsr: Performance improvement for GenerateFarfieldList in Schematic; Moved CDF calculation from ff template into this lib
' 05-Jun-2020 fsr: Restored [Auto] renaming in envelope calculation for bwc; only write ff envelope once; delete ff envelopes on rebuild
